sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employer
  actor A as Admin
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  E->>API: POST /employer/companies
  API->>DB: company + owner membership
  E->>API: POST /employer/companies/{id}/verification
  API->>DB: verification record with signals, status=pending
  A->>API: POST /admin/companies/{id}/verification {approve}
  API->>DB: status=verified, audit, notify owners
  E->>API: POST /employer/jobs/parse {description}
  API-->>E: suggested requirements (advisory, not saved)
  E->>API: POST /employer/companies/{id}/jobs (draft)
  E->>API: POST /employer/jobs/{id}/status {published}
  API->>API: membership(write), state machine, company verified, deadline
  API->>DB: status=published (pending_review if moderation enabled), embedding, audit
